      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Good day dear Asphodel\_! And how\u2019s little Dilemma doing\_?\r\n\r\nLook, er\u2026 I get too hot in here\u2026 especially when fencing, you know, all the activity, the intimacy with my enemy\u2026 It\u2019s very physical\_! I need a potion that would help me stop my heart from burning\u2026 Uh I mean my body, of course.\r\nI need to be as cold as steel, an Icy Blade to tear my enemies apart with no regrets."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: aca00d34822fa8b489cd878ae69cb07d, type: 2}
